OL,3,AArgentina targets UK in legal claim
OL,4,Aover Falklands oil exploration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Argentinian government has begun
OL,7,Flegal action seeking to stop the
OL,8,Fexploration of oil and gas fields north
OL,9,Fof the Falkland Islands in an
OL,10,Fescalating row with the UK.
OL,12,FBuenos Aires said in a statement the
OL,13,Frequest lodged with the International
OL,14,FTribunal for the Law of the Sea aimed
OL,15,Fto block activity authorised
OL,16,F"illegally" by the UK.
OL,18,FThe claim comes a fortnight after
OL,19,FArgentinian President Javier Milei
OL,20,Fdemanded the scrapping of the Sea Lion
OL,21,Foilfield project, a joint venture
OL,22,Fbetween Israeli and British companies.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
