OL,3,AArgentina targets UK in legal claim
OL,4,Aover Falklands oil exploration
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Foreign Office minister Uma Kumaran
OL,7,Fcriticised the "escalating campaign"
OL,8,Ffrom Argentina against companies
OL,9,Foperating in the Falklands, while
OL,10,Fannouncing new protections for them.
